<mxCell id="c92" value="KOL downloads own link; Shop Manager must own its Store; SYSTEM_ADMIN / SYSTEM_MANAGER can support. Invalid options 400; missing/deleted link 404; forbidden 403; rate limit 429. UI keeps the dialog and shows errors; it does not substitute the local preview for a failed download." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="2383" width="3400" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c93" value="Counter/support audit failures do not block image delivery. Backend inline preview is a separate API option (60/min, no download count). Status/expiry are enforced on redirect after scanning; QR generation does not reject PAUSED/BLOCKED/expired records solely by status." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="2438" width="3400" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
